      <node id="Spoegwolf" label="Spoegwolf">
        <attvalues>
          <attvalue for="0" value="concept" />
          <attvalue for="5" value="An Afrikaans band known for their poetic lyrics and exploration of themes like identity and belonging." />
          <attvalue for="3" value="Music" />
          <attvalue for="6" value="2025-03-06 23:54:43.573769" />
          <attvalue for="7" value="['persona_16', 'persona_17', 'persona_63']" />
          <attvalue for="8" value="[{'description': &quot;Spoegwolf's music, while not explicitly political, resonates with themes of belonging and resistance.&quot;, 'evidence': &quot;There's this one Spoegwolf song that talks about this feeling of belonging and resistance, almost like a protest.&quot;, 'novelty_score': 0.7, 'timestamp': '2025-03-06 23:54:43.573914', 'source_conversation': ['persona_16', 'persona_17', 'persona_63']}, {'description': &quot;Spoegwolf is the first Afrikaans band to top the iTunes charts worldwide, breaking barriers similar to the growing recognition of women's football.&quot;, 'evidence': &quot;Spoegwolf Fan: 'Spoegwolf is the first Afrikaans band to ever top the iTunes charts worldwide... much like how women's football is gaining more recognition globally.'&quot;, 'novelty_score': 0.9, 'timestamp': '2025-03-06 23:54:43.574300', 'source_conversation': ['persona_16', 'persona_63']}, {'description': 'Both music and sports offer powerful narratives that resonate with fans, creating a deep connection and sense of community.', 'evidence': &quot;Women's Football Fan: 'Football, too, is full of stories... It's amazing how these narratives can draw you in.'&quot;, 'novelty_score': 0.8, 'timestamp': '2025-03-06 23:54:43.574326', 'source_conversation': ['persona_16', 'persona_63']}, {'description': 'Both music and politics can motivate and inspire people toward change or reflection.', 'evidence': &quot;I suppose there's a similarity in how both music and politics can motivate and inspire people toward change, or at least reflection.&quot;, 'novelty_score': 0.8, 'timestamp': '2025-03-06 23:57:23.650127', 'source_conversation': ['persona_16', 'persona_17']}, {'description': &quot;Spoegwolf's success as the first Afrikaans group to top the Apple Music charts in South Africa highlights the impact of Afrikaans music.&quot;, 'evidence': 'Spoegwolf is the first Afrikaans group to top the Apple Music charts in South Africa.', 'novelty_score': 0.8, 'timestamp': '2025-03-06 23:57:23.650132', 'source_conversation': ['persona_16', 'persona_17']}, {'description': 'Music and politics both aim to connect with people on a deep level, addressing real-life issues and emotions.', 'evidence': &quot;It's kind of like how a good political movement should resonate with people's real lives, you know?&quot;, 'novelty_score': 0.8, 'timestamp': '2025-03-06 23:59:48.586044', 'source_conversation': ['persona_16', 'persona_17']}, {'description': 'The concept of home and belonging is a shared theme in both music and politics, influencing how people perceive their place in the world.', 'evidence': &quot;There's this one Spoegwolf song that talks about the idea of home and belonging.&quot;, 'novelty_score': 0.8, 'timestamp': '2025-03-06 23:59:48.586070', 'source_conversation': ['persona_16', 'persona_17']}, {'description': 'Spoegwolf was the first Afrikaans band to top the Apple Music charts in South Africa, highlighting their impact in the Afrikaans music scene.', 'evidence': &quot;Spoegwolf Fan: 'Did you know that Spoegwolf was the first Afrikaans band to top the Apple Music charts in South Africa?'&quot;, 'novelty_score': 0.9, 'timestamp': '2025-03-07 00:02:40.834189', 'source_conversation': ['persona_16', 'persona_17']}, {'description': 'There is potential for crossover between music and sports, such as playing Spoegwolf at football matches.', 'evidence': 'Who knows, maybe they’ll start playing Spoegwolf at football matches.', 'novelty_score': 0.7, 'timestamp': '2025-03-07 00:02:40.834809', 'source_conversation': ['persona_16', 'persona_63']}, {'description': 'Spoegwolf was the first Afrikaans band to reach number one across all genres on the South African iTunes charts.', 'evidence': 'Spoegwolf was the first Afrikaans band to reach number one across all genres on the South African iTunes charts.', 'novelty_score': 0.9, 'timestamp': '2025-03-07 00:05:37.851446', 'source_conversation': ['persona_16', 'persona_17']}, {'description': 'Music and politics can evoke similar feelings of solidarity and belonging.', 'evidence': &quot;It's interesting how music and politics can evoke similar feelings of solidarity and belonging.&quot;, 'novelty_score': 0.8, 'timestamp': '2025-03-07 00:05:37.851452', 'source_conversation': ['persona_16', 'persona_17']}, {'description': 'Unexpected successes in music or politics can inspire hope and remind people that change is possible.', 'evidence': &quot;Whether it's a band breaking through or a political movement gaining traction, it reminds you that change is possible.&quot;, 'novelty_score': 0.8, 'timestamp': '2025-03-07 00:05:37.851490', 'source_conversation': ['persona_16', 'persona_17']}]" />
        </attvalues>
      </node>
