          <attvalue for="8" value="[{'description': 'Both music and politics can motivate and inspire people toward change or reflection.', 'evidence': &quot;I suppose there's a similarity in how both music and politics can motivate and inspire people toward change, or at least reflection.&quot;, 'novelty_score': 0.8, 'timestamp': '2025-03-06 23:57:23.650130', 'source_conversation': ['persona_16', 'persona_17']}, {'description': 'Music and politics both aim to connect with people on a deep level, addressing real-life issues and emotions.', 'evidence': &quot;It's kind of like how a good political movement should resonate with people's real lives, you know?&quot;, 'novelty_score': 0.8, 'timestamp': '2025-03-06 23:59:48.586052', 'source_conversation': ['persona_16', 'persona_17']}, {'description': 'Supporting a cause or a band can create a sense of community and shared purpose.', 'evidence': &quot;There's something magical about supporting a cause or a band that really speaks to you. It's almost like a community, isn't it?&quot;, 'novelty_score': 0.7, 'timestamp': '2025-03-06 23:59:48.586087', 'source_conversation': ['persona_16', 'persona_17']}, {'description': 'Music and politics can evoke similar feelings of solidarity and belonging.', 'evidence': &quot;It's interesting how music and politics can evoke similar feelings of solidarity and belonging.&quot;, 'novelty_score': 0.8, 'timestamp': '2025-03-07 00:05:37.851457', 'source_conversation': ['persona_16', 'persona_17']}, {'description': 'Unexpected successes in music or politics can inspire hope and remind people that change is possible.', 'evidence': &quot;Whether it's a band breaking through or a political movement gaining traction, it reminds you that change is possible.&quot;, 'novelty_score': 0.8, 'timestamp': '2025-03-07 00:05:37.851495', 'source_conversation': ['persona_16', 'persona_17']}]" />
        </attvalues>
      </node>
      <node id="Music and Politics" label="Music and Politics">
        <attvalues>
          <attvalue for="0" value="concept" />
          <attvalue for="5" value="The idea that music and politics can both generate strong community and passion." />
          <attvalue for="3" value="Sociocultural" />
          <attvalue for="6" value="2025-03-06 23:54:43.573804" />
          <attvalue for="7" value="['persona_16', 'persona_17', 'persona_63']" />
          <attvalue for="8" value="[{'description': 'Music can serve as a tool for change and cultural preservation, similar to political movements.', 'evidence': &quot;I read somewhere about music being used in revolutionary movements in history. It's not just entertainment; it's a tool for change.&quot;, 'novelty_score': 0.8, 'timestamp': '2025-03-06 23:54:43.573889', 'source_conversation': ['persona_16', 'persona_17', 'persona_63']}, {'description': &quot;Spoegwolf's music, while not explicitly political, resonates with themes of belonging and resistance.&quot;, 'evidence': &quot;There's this one Spoegwolf song that talks about this feeling of belonging and resistance, almost like a protest.&quot;, 'novelty_score': 0.7, 'timestamp': '2025-03-06 23:54:43.573920', 'source_conversation': ['persona_16', 'persona_17', 'persona_63']}]" />
        </attvalues>
      </node>
      <node id="Live Performances" label="Live Performances">
        <attvalues>
          <attvalue for="0" value="concept" />
          <attvalue for="5" value="Events where Spoegwolf performs live, creating a powerful, communal experience." />
          <attvalue for="3" value="Music" />
          <attvalue for="6" value="2025-03-06 23:54:43.573812" />
          <attvalue for="7" value="['persona_16', 'persona_17', 'persona_63']" />
          <attvalue for="8" value="[{'description': 'Both music concerts and sports matches create a collective energy that unites people.', 'evidence': 'There’s this collective energy in the stadium. It’s like everyone is in sync, even if they’re strangers.', 'novelty_score': 0.7, 'timestamp': '2025-03-07 00:05:37.851619', 'source_conversation': ['persona_16', 'persona_63']}, {'description': 'Being a fan, whether of music or sports, is about being part of a community and experiencing something bigger than oneself.', 'evidence': 'It’s about being part of a community. And even though our fields are different, I guess we both know what it’s like to be swept up in something bigger than ourselves.', 'novelty_score': 0.9, 'timestamp': '2025-03-07 00:05:37.851651', 'source_conversation': ['persona_16', 'persona_63']}]" />
        </attvalues>
      </node>
      <node id="Cultural Preservation" label="Cultural Preservation">
