          <attvalue for="7" value="['persona_16', 'persona_63']" />
          <attvalue for="8" value="[{'description': &quot;Spoegwolf is the first Afrikaans band to top the iTunes charts worldwide, breaking barriers similar to the growing recognition of women's football.&quot;, 'evidence': &quot;Spoegwolf Fan: 'Spoegwolf is the first Afrikaans band to ever top the iTunes charts worldwide... much like how women's football is gaining more recognition globally.'&quot;, 'novelty_score': 0.9, 'timestamp': '2025-03-06 23:54:43.574314', 'source_conversation': ['persona_16', 'persona_63']}, {'description': 'Both music and sports offer powerful narratives that resonate with fans, creating a deep connection and sense of community.', 'evidence': &quot;Women's Football Fan: 'Football, too, is full of stories... It's amazing how these narratives can draw you in.'&quot;, 'novelty_score': 0.8, 'timestamp': '2025-03-06 23:54:43.574359', 'source_conversation': ['persona_16', 'persona_63']}, {'description': 'Both music and sports have elements of unpredictability that enhance their appeal.', 'evidence': 'It’s that unpredictability that makes it exciting. I guess both music and sports have that element of surprise.', 'novelty_score': 0.8, 'timestamp': '2025-03-07 00:02:40.834759', 'source_conversation': ['persona_16', 'persona_63']}, {'description': 'There is potential for crossover between music and sports, such as playing Spoegwolf at football matches.', 'evidence': 'Who knows, maybe they’ll start playing Spoegwolf at football matches.', 'novelty_score': 0.7, 'timestamp': '2025-03-07 00:02:40.834832', 'source_conversation': ['persona_16', 'persona_63']}, {'description': &quot;South Africa has a strong women's football league, which is not widely known.&quot;, 'evidence': 'By the way, did you know that in South Africa, there’s a strong women’s football league too?', 'novelty_score': 0.6, 'timestamp': '2025-03-07 00:02:40.834851', 'source_conversation': ['persona_16', 'persona_63']}]" />
        </attvalues>
