          <attvalue for="7" value="['persona_24', 'persona_70', 'persona_16', 'persona_17', 'persona_4']" />
          <attvalue for="8" value="[{'description': 'Music and robotics share a mathematical foundation, suggesting a universal language of patterns.', 'evidence': 'Music theory is very much about patterns and structures, similar to coding.', 'novelty_score': 0.7, 'timestamp': '2025-03-06 23:59:48.586277', 'source_conversation': ['persona_24', 'persona_70', 'persona_16', 'persona_17', 'persona_4']}, {'description': 'A harmonious approach in robotics could lead to innovations that are both functional and aesthetically pleasing.', 'evidence': 'Perhaps a more harmonious approach to robotics could lead to innovations that are both functional and beautiful.', 'novelty_score': 0.75, 'timestamp': '2025-03-06 23:59:48.586353', 'source_conversation': ['persona_24', 'persona_70', 'persona_16', 'persona_17', 'persona_4']}, {'description': 'Both music and political movements aim to connect with people on a personal level, giving a voice to those who might not always be heard.', 'evidence': &quot;Die Linke Supporter: 'Music and politics both aim to connect with people on a personal level. I guess in some ways, both Spoegwolf and Die Linke are about giving a voice to those who might not always be heard.'&quot;, 'novelty_score': 0.8, 'timestamp': '2025-03-07 00:02:40.834149', 'source_conversation': ['persona_16', 'persona_17']}, {'description': 'Spoegwolf was the first Afrikaans band to top the Apple Music charts in South Africa, highlighting their impact in the Afrikaans music scene.', 'evidence': &quot;Spoegwolf Fan: 'Did you know that Spoegwolf was the first Afrikaans band to top the Apple Music charts in South Africa?'&quot;, 'novelty_score': 0.9, 'timestamp': '2025-03-07 00:02:40.834206', 'source_conversation': ['persona_16', 'persona_17']}, {'description': 'Passion and authenticity in both music and politics can resonate deeply with people, making a significant difference.', 'evidence': &quot;Spoegwolf Fan: 'And it's a reminder that passion and authenticity can really resonate with people. Whether it's through music or politics, I think that's what truly makes a difference.'&quot;, 'novelty_score': 0.8, 'timestamp': '2025-03-07 00:02:40.834224', 'source_conversation': ['persona_16', 'persona_17']}, {'description': 'Music and sports activate similar parts of the brain, leading to a sense of connection during events.', 'evidence': 'There’s this study I read once about how music and sports activate similar parts of the brain.', 'novelty_score': 0.8, 'timestamp': '2025-03-07 00:05:37.851615', 'source_conversation': ['persona_16', 'persona_63']}]" />
        </attvalues>
      </node>
