          <attvalue for="8" value="[{'description': 'Both music and political movements aim to connect with people on a personal level, giving a voice to those who might not always be heard.', 'evidence': &quot;Die Linke Supporter: 'Music and politics both aim to connect with people on a personal level. I guess in some ways, both Spoegwolf and Die Linke are about giving a voice to those who might not always be heard.'&quot;, 'novelty_score': 0.8, 'timestamp': '2025-03-07 00:02:40.834171', 'source_conversation': ['persona_16', 'persona_17']}, {'description': 'Passion and authenticity in both music and politics can resonate deeply with people, making a significant difference.', 'evidence': &quot;Spoegwolf Fan: 'And it's a reminder that passion and authenticity can really resonate with people. Whether it's through music or politics, I think that's what truly makes a difference.'&quot;, 'novelty_score': 0.8, 'timestamp': '2025-03-07 00:02:40.834239', 'source_conversation': ['persona_16', 'persona_17']}]" />
