          <attvalue for="9" value="Both require practice, dedication, and understanding of fundamentals." />
          <attvalue for="10" value="['Both require practice, dedication, and a deep understanding of the fundamentals.', &quot;It's like... well, I suppose it's a bit like how you can't just dribble a basketball and expect to become a pro. There's technique, strategy, and a lot of practice involved.&quot;]" />
