        <attvalues>
          <attvalue for="9" value="Music theory involves understanding technical rules to enhance creativity." />
          <attvalue for="10" value="['Students often think theory is restrictive, but once they grasp the technical aspects, they find a whole new level of freedom in playing.']" />
